---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="ESNNA Prevention | Tours Peruvian Travel" description="Our commitment to the Prevention of Sexual Exploitation of Children and Adolescents (ESNNA) in tourism.">
  <div class="pt-24 pb-16 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-slate-100">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6 mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-slate-100">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 mb-1">ESNNA Prevention</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm md:text-base">Our commitment to responsible and safe tourism.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-sm max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-slate-800 prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-li:text-slate-600">
          <img src="/Logo-ESNNA-Nacional.avif" alt="Protégeme Turismo Responsable ESNNA" width={200} height={100} class="w-32 md:w-48 float-right ml-6 mb-4 object-contain rounded-lg" />
          <p class="font-medium">At <strong>Tours Peruvian service</strong> we strongly reject and are committed to the Prevention of the Sexual Exploitation of Children and Adolescents (ESNNA) in the tourism sector.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-lg mt-8 mb-4">What is ESNNA?</h2>
          <p>The Sexual Exploitation of Children and Adolescents is a serious violation of human rights and a crime punishable by Peruvian and international law. It involves using minors for sexual purposes in exchange for remuneration or other benefits.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-lg mt-8 mb-4">Our Commitment</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mt-4 mb-8 list-disc pl-5">
            <li><strong>Zero Tolerance:</strong> We do not tolerate any form of sexual exploitation of minors in our operations or in our value chain.</li>
            <li><strong>Training:</strong> Our staff is informed and trained to identify and report possible cases of ESNNA.</li>
            <li><strong>Communication:</strong> We promote a culture of child protection among our clients, suppliers, and collaborators.</li>
            <li><strong>Collaboration:</strong> We actively cooperate with local and national authorities in case of detecting any suspicious situation.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 mt-10 border border-orange-100 text-sm">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-orange-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
              </svg>
              Reporting Channels
            </h3>
            <p class="text-orange-900 mb-0">If you witness a case of Sexual Exploitation of Children and Adolescents, report it immediately to the Peruvian authorities:</p>
            <ul class="list-none pl-0 mt-4 space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-orange-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">105</span>
                <span class="text-orange-900 font-medium">Peruvian National Police</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-orange-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1818</span>
                <span class="text-orange-900 font-medium">Ministry of the Interior's Unique Reporting Line</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
